---
// Fundations
import Text from "@/components/fundations/elements/Text.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
---

<section>
  <Wrapper variant="standard" class="pt-20 pb-12 lg:pt-30">
    <div class="pb-2 border-b border-dotted border-primary/10">
      <Text tag="h1" variant="textBase" class="text-primary">
        Entrepreneur, Futurist, AI Engineer, Educator, Impact Investor,
        <br>
        Regenerative Designer, Longevity Enthusiast, Polymath-in-Training
      </Text>
      <Text
        tag="p"
        variant="textBase"
        class="font-serif text-primary/60 text-balance"
      >
        Actualizing a sustainable future by innovating towards a more resilient society.
      </Text>

      <div class="mt-4 pt-4">
      <Text
        tag="p"
        variant="textBase"
        class="font-serif text-primary/60 text-balance mt-4"
      >
        My work is driven by the desire to explore beauty across multiple domains at a high level of understanding. This pursuit requires a foundation of individual longevity and a resilient societal structure to ensure our contributions endure. I use entrepreneurship and research as the mediums to bridge deep theory with scalable impact.
      </Text>

      <Text
        tag="p"
        variant="textBase"
        class="font-serif text-primary/60 text-balance mt-4"
      >
        My practice is guided by several core inquiries:
      </Text>

      <ul class="font-serif text-primary/60 text-balance mt-2 space-y-2 list-disc list-outside pl-6 marker:text-primary/50">
        <li class="pl-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0">
          <span class="relative inline-block shrink-0">
            <span
              class="text-sm font-semibold font-sans text-primary"
              data-rough-highlight="domain-dfs"
            >
              Design and Futures Studies
            </span>
          </span>
          How do we bring intention into innovating toward the right initiatives for long-term interests?
        </li>
        <li class="pl-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0">
          <span class="relative inline-block shrink-0">
            <span
              class="text-sm font-semibold font-sans text-primary"
              data-rough-highlight="domain-bet"
            >
              Business, Technology, and Entrepreneurship
            </span>
          </span>
          How do we build organizations and societal structures at scale to facilitate these initiatives?
        </li>
        <li class="pl-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0">
          <span class="relative inline-block shrink-0">
            <span
              class="text-sm font-semibold font-sans text-primary"
              data-rough-highlight="domain-lkm"
            >
              Learning Science and Knowledge Management
            </span>
          </span>
          How do we redesign education to prepare the workforce in order to deliver these initiatives?
        </li>
        <li class="pl-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0">
          <span class="relative inline-block shrink-0">
            <span
              class="text-sm font-semibold font-sans text-primary"
              data-rough-highlight="domain-sdev"
            >
              Sustainable Development
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="relative inline-block shrink-0">
            <span
              class="text-sm font-semibold font-sans text-primary"
              data-rough-highlight="domain-hfl"
            >
              Health, Fitness, and Longevity
            </span>
          </span>
          How do we keep these individual and systemic processes going forever?
        </li>
      </ul>

      <Text
        tag="p"
        variant="textBase"
        class="font-serif text-primary/60 text-balance mt-4"
      >
        Hence, I have captured these five primary domains as my primary lenses for mapping out knowledge. These questions ensure my work contributes to a cohesive, sustainable, and abundant future. 
      </Text>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Wrapper>
</section>
